         customer, so BR-AE-02 demands a Seller identifier AND a Buyer id,
       * 2x BG-25 invoice lines, BOTH with BT-151 line VAT category = AE and
         BT-152 line VAT rate = 0 (BR-AE-05),
       * exactly ONE BG-23 VAT breakdown with BT-118 category AE, BT-116 taxable
         = Σ AE line nets, and BT-117 tax amount = 0.00 (BR-AE-01/08/09),
